  "application_type": "Householder",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The\r\nproposed three storey side extension roof form,&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;by reason of its poor design would create a poorly\r\nconceived, incongruous and contrived form of development that fails to\r\nappropriately relate or respond to the original dwellinghouse. The proposal&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;would give rise to a disproportionate addition which would fail to provide a coherent pattern of development in the street scene, and would therefore unduly harm the form, openness and proportion of the site and&amp;nbsp; relationship with the properties in the locality.&amp;nbsp;by reason of its design and appearance at\r\nground floor level. The\r\nproposal would therefore be contrary to the high quality design aspirations of\r\nthe National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies D3.D(1) and D3.D(11) of\r\nThe London Plan (2021), Policy CS.1B of the Harrow Core Strategy (2012), Policy\r\nDM1 of the Development Management Plan Local Policies (2013) and the Adopted\r\nSupplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
